---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Notes" description="Short observations, questions, and work in progress from Brian Reymore.">
  <main>
    <header class="editorial-hero editorial-hero--notes"><div class="kicker">Observations along the way</div><h1>Notes</h1><p>Not every thought needs a thousand words. Some need room to breathe.</p></header>
    <section class="container reading"><div class="kicker">In preparation</div><h2 class="section-title">Fragments worth keeping.</h2><p class="lede">A place for shorter reflections, questions, and ideas still finding their shape. Notes will appear here as the collection grows.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/essays">Read the Essays</a></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
